{"5452980":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"mirror","steam_appid":5452980,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the mirror, the road leads left<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a sleepless night, your reflection smiles back at you. The next moment, you wake in a strange forest.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl named Lumière pleads: &quot;Our kingdom was stolen by a false king. Please, help me take it back.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mirror world everything is reversed, and your journey runs to the left.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]Build your own fighting style<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap sword skills and magic, parry enemy attacks with perfect timing and strike back in this responsive side-scrolling action game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, evolve your skills through the skill tree, and shape a style that is yours alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirror-world mechanics<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curses that swap left and right, gravity that pins you to the ceiling, mirrors that reflect your magic.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the mirror world tries to deceive you.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the mirror, the road leads left<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a sleepless night, your reflection smiles back at you. The next moment, you wake in a strange forest.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl named Lumière pleads: &quot;Our kingdom was stolen by a false king. Please, help me take it back.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mirror world everything is reversed, and your journey runs to the left.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2]Build your own fighting style<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap sword skills and magic, parry enemy attacks with perfect timing and strike back in this responsive side-scrolling action game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, evolve your skills through the skill tree, and shape a style that is yours alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirror-world mechanics<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curses that swap left and right, gravity that pins you to the ceiling, mirrors that reflect your magic.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the mirror world tries to deceive you.<\/p>","short_description":"One sleepless night, you look into a mirror and fall into Kyoukai, the world behind the glass. A girl named Lumière asks you to help take back her stolen kingdom, and in the mirror world the road leads left. Parry, swap sword skills and six elements of magic, this action RPG.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5452980\/33ba874798bbdf28dbb26fdcb04c972578e8f650\/header.jpg?t=1793710210","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5452980\/c24290bd5b36c6698a9f166c914a7490394bbc6a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793710210","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5452980\/c24290bd5b36c6698a9f166c914a7490394bbc6a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793710210","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10（64bit）<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 クラス（2コア以上）<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 \/ NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":[" as"],"publishers":["as"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":99,"final":99,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"0,99€"},"packages":[1881750